  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Democracy and Electoral Processes in Mozambique for the Electoral Cycle 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective of the programme is to enhance Democracy and Electoral Processes in Mozambique for the Electoral Cycle 2022-2025.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It will provide Technical assistance to the Electoral Management Bodies (CNE and STAE) as well as to other stakeholders involved in the electoral process such as the police, the judiciary, etc. It will have a special focus on women, youth and people with disabilities. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Component 1:Strengthened technical capacities of electoral stakeholders to promote credible and inclusive electoral processes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Component 2: Enhanced transparency in the electoral process through greater public outreach and information sharing by EMBs to the voters&#xbf; population &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Component 3: Improved electoral operations planning and electoral processes during the electoral cycle including during the crisis such as COVID-19, natural disasters, security threats and political violence&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Component 4:Enhanced effectiveness and transparency of the Electoral Dispute Resolution mechanism through technical assistance to the Constitutional Council, CNE, and Supreme Court&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
